This plugin bundles a prebuilt rendering engine (runtime/) that links against:

  * Live2D Cubism SDK for Native, release 5-r.5
    Copyright (c) Live2D Inc.  All rights reserved.
    Use of this software is governed by the Live2D Open Software License
    (https://www.live2d.com/eula/live2d-open-software-license-agreement_en.html)
    and, for the Cubism Core library (Live2DCubismCore.dll), the
    Live2D Proprietary Software License Agreement.

  * Microsoft .NET 10 runtime and Windows Forms / WPF assemblies (MIT).

No Live2D model, texture, or other artwork is included in this plugin.
